    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοϊκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῦς</span> B)
